ios, que salva a los rectos de corazón.", "words": [[0, 70598], [3, 70598], [10, 70843], [15, 71023], [18, 71203], [24, 71443], [28, 71663], [34, 72163], [36, 72343], [40, 72463], [47, 72923], [50, 73023]]}, {"verse": 11, "start": 74145, "end": 80888, "text": "Dios es el que juzga al justo: y Dios está airado todos los días contra el impío.", "words": [[0, 74145], [5, 74429], [8, 74809], [11, 74989], [15, 75329], [21, 75669], [24, 75829], [31, 76706], [33, 76830], [38, 77130], [43, 77630], [50, 78370], [56, 78690], [60, 79030], [65, 79310], [72, 79750], [75, 80010]]}, {"verse": 12, "start": 81238, "end": 87786, "text": "Si no se arrepiente, él afilará su espada: armado tiene ya su arco, y lo ha preparado.", "words": [[0, 81238], [3, 81419], [6, 81619], [9, 81819], [21, 82679], [24, 83039], [32, 83579], [35, 83699], [43, 84596], [50, 85057], [56, 85297], [59, 85577], [62, 85777], [68, 86237], [70, 86737], [73, 86877], [76, 87037]]}, {"verse": 13, "start": 88136, "end": 94454, "text": "Asimismo ha preparado para él armas de muerte; ha labrado sus flechas para los que persiguen.", "words": [[0, 88136], [9, 88881], [12, 89001], [22, 89621], [27, 89861], [30, 90121], [36, 90541], [39, 90781], [47, 91921], [50, 92147], [58, 92374], [62, 92614], [70, 93194], [75, 93414], [79, 93574], [83, 93734]]}, {"verse": 14, "start": 94804, "end": 100171, "text": "He aquí ha tenido parto de iniquidad: concibió trabajo, y parió mentira.", "words": [[0, 94919], [3, 95034], [8, 95314], [11, 95594], [18, 95914], [24, 96714], [27, 96814], [38, 97878], [47, 98422], [56, 98862], [58, 99182], [64, 99482]]}, {"verse": 15, "start": 100521, "end": 105150, "text": "Pozo ha cavado, y lo ha ahondado; y en la fosa que hizo caerá.", "words": [[0, 100735], [5, 100985], [8, 101235], [16, 101485], [18, 101685], [21, 101805], [24, 101945], [34, 103111], [36, 103357], [39, 103477], [42, 103637], [47, 103997], [51, 104197], [56, 104417]]}, {"verse": 16, "start": 105500, "end": 111553, "text": "Su iniquidad se volverá sobre su cabeza, y su agravio descenderá sobre su mollera.", "words": [[0, 105500], [3, 105703], [13, 106623], [16, 106883], [24, 107423], [30, 107703], [33, 107943], [41, 108363], [43, 108623], [46, 108823], [54, 109483], [65, 110383], [71, 110683], [74, 111154]]}, {"verse": 17, "start": 111903, "end": 118197, "text": "Alabaré yo a Jehová conforme a su justicia, y cantaré al nombre de Jehová el Altísimo.", "words": [[0, 112136], [8, 112410], [11, 112683], [13, 112843], [20, 113303], [29, 113633], [31, 113963], [34, 114103], [44, 114883], [46, 115383], [54, 115943], [57, 116143], [64, 116483], [67, 116683], [74, 117183], [77, 117283]]}]}